      "text": "Convolution3D evaluates one bounded convolution operator in three grid-order layouts. CUDAjl selects three explicit functions; KA/JACC specialize one body with Val(STYLE). Convolution1D times24 input/mask/type groups and15 mode/blockwidth paths per group across Float64,Float32 andInt16. These specializations describe mappings, not independent scientific families, and their precision projections must not be added into one roofline peak or used to infer causal performance.",
